{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：08:23 2026-11-22 HKT<br/>發佈時間：08:23 2026-11-22 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：08:23 2026-11-22 HKT</p><img alt=\"華為發布首款鴻蒙AI手機，定價5699元起。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d8b479de5358a49dce448492c967346f/2026-11/KF_-Sam_-_2026-11-22T082220_453.png\"/><p>華為子品牌OSTA星芒前日發布首款為AI而生的鴻蒙手機「OSTA O1 Pro」，定價由5699元起（人民幣，下同）。</p><p>新機首發搭載HarmonyOS 7 AI先鋒版及麒麟9030S晶片，主打革新交互體驗。用戶解鎖屏幕，便直接進入華為研發的AI助手「小藝」對話欄，只需一句語音便可調用常用應用程式及發訊息。</p><p>產品開售後掀起搶購熱潮，8999元高配版本全平台售罄，但亦有網友嫌貴。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T00:52:06.587085+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":272,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T00:23:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T07:50:31.055257+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T00:45:38.721642+00:00","content_hash":"4975d4e2384ef066a7edf530409242e5e09792b8740320ffbd32bb353e726d9f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}